payload.ingredientsText:
cherry almond - rosehip shell, rooibos, hibiscus, orange fruit, lemon leaves, stevia leaves and flavours almond and cherry cinnamon and malic acid;
spiced wine - hibiscus, apple, lemon leaf, cinnamon, stevia leaves, nutmeg, clove and flavour cinnamon and natural flavour grape;
orange spice - rosehip shell, hibiscus, cinnamon, orange fruit, stevia leaves and flavours orange and cinnamon;
hot apple - hibiscus, apple, cinnamon, lemon leaf, stevia leaves and flavours apple, cinnamon and malic acid.
